            "sid": "1CH 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kunini worra balbala gosa isaani iti mataa, Meshobabu, Yameleki, Yoshua ilma Amazia, Yoeli, Yehu (ilma Yoshibia, ilma Seraya, ilma Asieli), Elioenai, Yaakoba, Yeshoaya, Asaya, Adieli, Yesimieli, Benaiya, Ziza (ilma Shifi ilma Alloni, ilma Yedaya ilma Shimri ilma Shemaya).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.34+1CH.4.35+1CH.4.36+1CH.4.37+1CH.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.34",
              "1CH.4.35",
              "1CH.4.36",
              "1CH.4.37",
              "1CH.4.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri hore lafa ira dabre jennaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.34+1CH.4.35+1CH.4.36+1CH.4.37+1CH.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.34",
              "1CH.4.35",
              "1CH.4.36",
              "1CH.4.37",
              "1CH.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lafa ila adu gahe, diquma Gerari hanqate. Ammalle worri ree isaani bale diri Gerari ke jirtu gama ilaboru tifate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri lafa diida dansa, maraafi nagaya qabdu, ta nami d'ibiini keesa injirre, achiti arge, worri duri lafa suni keesa tau worra Hamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bara hayyuuni Hezekiani lafa Yuda fide, worri maqa isaani arma keesati t'aafani kunini Gerari d'aqe, waarofi mana worra achi jiru balleese. Worri worra suni keesaa gusse achi qubate, wonti akanatiifi lafti suni marra gudda ree worra quubsu qabdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami d'ibiini d'ibba shani, ka gosa Simeoni ilaboru godaane Edomuni bahe. Nami gaafasi worraani godaane ilmaani Ishi: Peletia, Nearia, Refaya, Uzili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiti worri worra gosa Amaleki ka woraana iraa hafe fit'e, haga arrale achuma taa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nama Reubeni d'ale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
